I guess you need to read the spoilers. It is high time you read them.

The healer will probably do better with a staff, a saber, or a short
sword.
But the best thing for healer is to use pets, as much as you can.
As a healer fighting yourself is not a good idea.
The archeologists start with a very good weapon, a pickaxe. Use it and
replace it
with the dwarvish mattock when you find it. It is the only weapon you
must use,
before finding a good artifact, maybe excalibur if you are lawful.

If you have reached level 18 even once you should practice the
protection racket (as a healer)
for building patience. And read spoilers (google for eva nethack
spoilers).
If you do the above you will be reaching the castle in no time.

